# Security headers for elfabulario.com (Cloudflare Pages)
# Apply to every path. CSP intentionally omitted: would need
# careful audit for Spotify embeds, Cloudflare email obfuscation
# and Pagefind. Add later as a separate PR.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), interest-cohort=()
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
